WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.610
No email address yet?

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:02.560
No problem.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.830
We'll make a free Gmail together.

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.760
Open Google's sign-up page.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.760
Type your first and last name, then your birthday.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.290
Pick 'Create your own Gmail address' and choose one you like,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.730
like your business name.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.340
Make a password you'll remember,

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:18.210
and write it down somewhere safe,

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.940
never on our page.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:24.000
Google may text you a code; type it on Google's page only.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.450
Click 'I agree', and you've got email.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.755
That's step one done.

